[] What do you mean by bones ??

bones is a special term in hack used to refer to the levels on which a
player has died and left a ghost sort of hovering over the players
inventory.  it has nothing to do with monster corpses.  anyone who
plays long enough and survives beyond the 1st 3 levels will eventually
encounter the ghost of a former player (perhaps your own).  you can
always, of course, save your game at any point during play ...

